{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Preserve immediate suspension and retry completion.** The manager may already select `PENDING`/`RETRYING`, but this synchronous handler call must return before that outcome is processed. A caught suspension or blocked `finally` therefore holds the Lambda until platform timeout, even without plugins. Bound cleanup using Lambda\u2019s remaining time and force an invocation retry before the deadline when the handler cannot unwind; add a non-returning-finally regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Ki0H","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":128,"observation_digest":"7530dd110feaa9aafb3f3fcb3f21b2fdeedcd11886e76de94715ae42648e6550","observation_id":"aro_v1_ouyn2eip5ku2v6z7h7ft6ins7x","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:23Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5yebu2crhve2yvxvednu65a4hs","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"14db8ae956d155999450c9262eec78bf71d38bdd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":125,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_3ldmxdlbokov6yr4obz5qxelrh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:23Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
